# Yuvex Tech Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit your real .env file or API keys to GitHub!

# Google Gemini API Key (Kept server-side or in local dev only)
# On deployment platforms (Vercel, Netlify, Cloud Run), add this as a secret environment variable in their dashboard.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
